{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14601080","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14601080","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1460108001:2":{"text":"暂时告别了依依不舍的莱卡他们，你们前往了荒角沙漠……","source_cn":"暂时告别了依依不舍的莱卡他们，你们前往了荒角沙漠……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08E0988D45E50732","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1460108002:0":{"text":"这里，就是沙漠吗？我还是第一次见到这种地方。","source_cn":"这里，就是沙漠吗？我还是第一次见到这种地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3A4A22A60FD15D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1460108003:0":{"text":"风很大，还很干燥——咳咳，还有不少沙子！","source_cn":"风很大，还很干燥——咳咳，还有不少沙子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E64289D0CD36D07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1460108003":{"text":"风很大，还很干燥——咳咳，还有不少沙子！","source_cn":"风很大，还很干燥——咳咳，还有不少沙子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E64289D0CD36D07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1460108004:0":{"text":"是的，空气很多时候都黏黏的，几乎会滴下水珠的程度。","source_cn":"是的，空气很多时候都黏黏的，几乎会滴下水珠的程度。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDB3D4ACB86E1591","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"",